 - `--format <json|markdown>` – output format (defaults to JSON). Markdown reports include human-readable summaries for review boards.
+- `--threshold <metric>=<min>` – require a metric to meet a minimum score (0–1). Can be specified multiple times. Exits with code 1 if any threshold fails; code 2 if malformed. Metrics with no score fail their threshold. Example: `--threshold exact_match=0.9 --threshold length_variance=0.5`.
 
